		"connected to natures power, summoning flora to aid you"
		"Nature school signature spells:"
		"• Thorns — 伤害 reflection aura"
		"• Poison Ivy — Entangles and poisons enemies"
		"• Natures Boon — Slow persistent regeneration"
		"• Summon Wolves — Calls wolves to fight alongside you"
